  id: juni_bloom
  displayName: Juni Bloom
  tagline: Gardener with a parasol and a green thumb.
  lore: Juni tends the hanging gardens of Sunspire Meadows and talks to every plant by name. Her leaf parasol opens into a shield, closes into a club, and throws razor leaves when she spins it. She hops like a seed on the wind.
